            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed is a vehicle comprising a vehicle system having a system having a number of loads defining a load profile; a validated battery comprising one or more batteries which can fulfill the load profile; an integrated battery selected from the validated battery, the integrated battery selected for longevity relative to other batteries; wherein the validated battery is provided within the vehicle. Further disclosed is a battery longevity predictor comprising a plurality of battery factors; a plurality of electrical load factors; a plurality of cycling or crank data; an output; wherein the output comprises a battery longevity predictor based on the plurality of battery factors, plurality of vehicle loads, and the plurality of cycling or crank data.</p>
            </abstract>
